  <data key="d2">Ano 3 indicates the third year designated for consolidation and preparation for long-term sustainability of the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Ano 3 refers to the third year when verification of carbon data will be conducted following the first period of monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Ano 3 refers to the third year of a project focusing on consolidation and long-term preparation related to mangrove restoration.&lt;SEP&gt;Ano 3 refers to the timeframe within which certain project milestones related to carbon verification and credits are expected to be achieved.</data>
