</node>
<node id="Canal do Linguado">
  <data key="d0">Canal do Linguado</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">O Canal do Linguado abriga remanescentes de manguezais no município de Balneário Barra do Sul.&lt;SEP&gt;Canal do Linguado is a waterway connecting the Lagoa Maria Fernanda and the delta of the river Perequê to the estuarine complex of Baía da Babitonga.&lt;SEP&gt;Canal do Linguado is a location referenced in the workshops, significant for the design requirements discussed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Canal do Linguado is a geographical area significant to the local fishing community, serving as a focal point in the project activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Canal do Linguado is a specific location where testing and design considerations for the ecobarrier are focused.&lt;SEP&gt;Canal do Linguado is a geographic location that needs logistical mapping prior to sending materials to SALIC.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-24923938ae8e02790d870d42e3ba2bb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-673052a26b4c0ea417f32d83fd85db70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fa52e6f66e339f041d2b2bcfa35c9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed9bcf559b12248b1273da40f56068e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47f28922da8d397aaccd4d34f84e64f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57e814d734f12e6e0e03507f0db90b8b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786227133</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manguezal">
  <data key="d0">Manguezal</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">Manguezal refers to a vital mangrove ecosystem that plays a crucial role in marine life support, environmental services, and climate change mitigation. This coastal ecosystem functions as a nursery for various marine species and is integral to biodiversity maintenance. Currently, Manguezal is undergoing restoration efforts aimed at recovering its ecological integrity and enhancing its functionality. These efforts are essential due to significant challenges faced by the ecosystem, including degradation from illegal activities and adverse environmental factors.

Monitoring initiatives have been implemented to assess the ecological significance of the mangrove areas and gauge the progress of restoration efforts. Manguezal is specifically the focus of conservation endeavors, including the PSA project, which seeks to preserve and restore this important ecosystem. Furthermore, it is part of a carbon credit project that highlights its capacity for carbon storage, emphasizing its role in climate change mitigation strategies.

Additionally, Manguezal is recognized for its community value and is actively involved in education and community engagement activities. It is a coastal environment of high climatic relevance, respected for its ecological importance and its contributions to both biodiversity and habitat preservation. Overall, Manguezal represents a crucial ecological zone that is not only being conserved and restored but also monitored to ensure its sustainability and resilience against environmental degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Manguezal refers to the mangrove ecosystem that the project aims to address through its prototype design and implementation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-24923938ae8e02790d870d42e3ba2bb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a446fc5d632dbd90edf121351c4e5b61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a75c0c8818e42f2e2febd37cd6d9e02d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a268042890d5d2e3c3a002cee6c290ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11946f35b487ac28aee0eba72daee33d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61799e391568f182c2b89677b9e0e003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-869a1472c792594402b404211a2b10ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f1b45c14b9998f471d578523b317bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce2d9c74993ce76ec57b683547157b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f0cd8bd143fd3559ba56c62695e2b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a84de646898e4c0c15a05010e9f0872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a890c76cd919e0baeeb5a5a0e3d9f027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f747942d3960f3f1bcfd90a773f335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f99a306340252731a22af065c2b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f1847a2487ac7c876527fa73acc8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93daf61580b578c58a15dff9e12f4585</data>
