<node id="Carbono Azul">
  <data key="d0">Carbono Azul</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbono azul é um termo que descreve o potencial de sequestro de carbono dos ecossistemas de mangue, mais eficiente que outros biomas.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbono Azul refers to the carbon credits associated with carbon storage in coastal ecosystems like mangroves.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbono Azul represents a national reference in solutions that connect various elements including mangroves and technology for environmental and social benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbono Azul refers to the concept of using coastal ecosystems like mangroves to capture and store carbon, addressing climate change while supporting local communities.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbono Azul refers to the ecological and economic benefits derived from blue carbon ecosystems such as mangroves, highlighting their importance in environmental strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbono Azul refers to the community and technical model validated by Karaguá Ecotech for carbon credit generation from mangrove ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbono Azul represents carbon stored and sequestered in coastal and marine environments, distinguishing Karaguá's assets from conventional forest carbon credits.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-24923938ae8e02790d870d42e3ba2bb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f1b45c14b9998f471d578523b317bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97956bf3a635abdaa08720534d192565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab5216ced144c274bc01b9f76450bfe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9ac0e037b36bcaa7b84fc97e0480a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aabdb3200838b9e69e29cf6cafc7b6da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f1847a2487ac7c876527fa73acc8f6</data>
