<node id="UDESC">
  <data key="d0">UDESC</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Universidade do Estado de Santa Catarina (UDESC) is a higher education institution that plays an active role in partnerships focused on ecological studies and sustainable management, particularly concerning mangrove ecosystems. This university is deeply involved in various scientific initiatives, including significant support for restoration projects aimed at environmental conservation.

In collaboration with Karaguá Ecotech, UDESC contributes to educational outreach efforts specifically tailored for communities in the areas of Joinville and Balneário Barra do Sul. This partnership not only fosters academic integration but also facilitates knowledge production in the field of environmental studies. UDESC is recognized as one of the key academic partners in the projects associated with Karaguá Ecotech, involving scholarships and applied research initiatives.

Through its research and extension projects, UDESC emphasizes its commitment to environmental conservation, contributing to a broader understanding of sustainable practices and their implementation in local ecosystems. The university's involvement showcases a dedication to scientific advancement and community education, underscoring its position as a pivotal player in ecological research and environmental stewardship in the region.&lt;SEP&gt;UDESC is a local university involved in Karaguá Ecotech's project for community engagement in environmental monitoring and restoration efforts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a446fc5d632dbd90edf121351c4e5b61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce2d9c74993ce76ec57b683547157b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f747942d3960f3f1bcfd90a773f335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9ac0e037b36bcaa7b84fc97e0480a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96cfbacbd794cb84c14c05802c670b7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f99a306340252731a22af065c2b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daf3f3a511399d27baaafacc8a1db9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026564c0148b51f6e4d359aee4d3338c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89141165cd3f083fc23989c3f15765c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aabdb3200838b9e69e29cf6cafc7b6da</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1779674942</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Univille">
  <data key="d0">Univille</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Univille is a university located in Brazil that actively engages in various research partnerships and educational initiatives, particularly focused on ecological studies, especially concerning mangrove areas. The institution collaborates with Karaguá Ecotech, emphasizing environmental issues and supporting scientific restoration projects. These collaborations aim to integrate local educational efforts, involving local students in research and practical applications concerning environmental sustainability.

Univille is noted for its academic partnerships within the region, facilitating collaborative projects that enhance the understanding of manguezal ecosystems. The university's involvement not only strengthens scientific research but also fosters educational development, promoting community engagement in environmental education related to ongoing initiatives. Overall, Univille plays a significant role as a higher education institution committed to ecological research and restoration efforts within its locality.&lt;SEP&gt;Univille is another university partnering with Karaguá Ecotech, contributing to project initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Univille is a local university participating in the Karaguá Ecotech project along with UDESC to support community engagement.&lt;SEP&gt;Univille is another educational institution that provides participants for the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Univille is another educational institution where local young students may qualify for research scholarships within the framework of the Laboratório Karaguá Vivo project.&lt;SEP&gt;Univille is an academic institution that is also considered for scholarship recipients in the workshops.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a446fc5d632dbd90edf121351c4e5b61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce2d9c74993ce76ec57b683547157b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f747942d3960f3f1bcfd90a773f335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9ac0e037b36bcaa7b84fc97e0480a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96cfbacbd794cb84c14c05802c670b7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f99a306340252731a22af065c2b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daf3f3a511399d27baaafacc8a1db9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026564c0148b51f6e4d359aee4d3338c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89141165cd3f083fc23989c3f15765c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aabdb3200838b9e69e29cf6cafc7b6da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4867a39f622d137bed16a6293ccd8fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fa52e6f66e339f041d2b2bcfa35c9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1e215cb25487527b01e8441005cff0</data>
