  <data key="d2">Lagoa Maria Fernanda is a lagoon that is part of the estuarine ecosystem connected to the Manguezal de Balneário Barra do Sul.&lt;SEP&gt;Lagoa Maria Fernanda is a geographic area where the manguezal is located and is subject to conservation efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Lagoa Maria Fernanda is a specific location targeted for mangrove restoration efforts within the document.</data>
