<node id="Baía da Babitonga">
  <data key="d0">Baía da Babitonga</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Baía da Babitonga is an estuarine bay located in northern Santa Catarina, Brazil, and is recognized as the largest estuary in the region. This bay forms part of the aquatic system linked to the Manguezal de Balneário Barra do Sul and is characterized by its extensive mangrove area, which is crucial for maintaining ecological balance. Stretching across 6,000 to 8,000 hectares, the mangroves of Baía da Babitonga are biologically significant, serving as a habitat for various marine species and playing a vital role in their reproduction.

The bay is not only ecologically important but also serves as a model for conservation and value generation, both for society and the market. It is targeted for scalable Blue Carbon models, highlighting its potential in carbon credit projects. Specifically, Baía da Babitonga is the focal point for projects such as the expansion of Karaguá’s mangrove restoration initiatives, which aim to restore and monitor up to 8,000 hectares of mangrove ecosystems.

Efforts are being made to expand the mangrove cover in Baía da Babitonga, thereby enhancing biodiversity conservation priorities in the area. The ongoing projects signify the bay's importance in addressing environmental challenges while benefiting local communities. Overall, Baía da Babitonga is a critical area for both ecological conservation and sustainable development initiatives in Santa Catarina.&lt;SEP&gt;Baía da Babitonga is the largest estuary in Santa Catarina, targeted for expansion of mangrove restoration efforts, estimated at 6,000 to 8,000 hectares.&lt;SEP&gt;Baía da Babitonga is a bay mentioned in the context of local knowledge and territory for the workshops.&lt;SEP&gt;The Baía da Babitonga is a location referenced in relation to the local knowledge and practices of fishermen and shellfish gatherers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-673052a26b4c0ea417f32d83fd85db70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97956bf3a635abdaa08720534d192565&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab5216ced144c274bc01b9f76450bfe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96cfbacbd794cb84c14c05802c670b7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41caa912aa9f8b079fabe8c7285d8d78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfd11d7c2c4bd3494e41a898407867fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daf3f3a511399d27baaafacc8a1db9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aabdb3200838b9e69e29cf6cafc7b6da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cf377716ee26ede13962ee6334fc04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56fa52e6f66e339f041d2b2bcfa35c9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57e814d734f12e6e0e03507f0db90b8b</data>
