  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Manejo-BBS is a document focusing on environmental management and restoration strategies, particularly concerning mangrove ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Manejo-BBS is a PDF document that contains information on environmental management practices, specifically regarding water flow correction and invasive species control.&lt;SEP&gt;Manejo-BBS is a document focused on carbon credit management and monitoring processes related to coastal ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Manejo-BBS is a document detailing strategic environmental actions and interventions related to a restoration project.&lt;SEP&gt;Manejo-BBS is a document containing information about a project focused on the restoration of mangroves, including community participation and environmental management strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Manejo-BBS is a document discussing the management and restoration of ecosystems, focusing on innovative practices and community engagement.</data>
