  <data key="d2">Mangrove refers to a coastal ecosystem characterized by salt-tolerant trees, essential for environmental health and biodiversity.&lt;SEP&gt;Mangroves are coastal ecosystems characterized by salt-tolerant trees and are a focus of restoration efforts discussed in the text.</data>
