  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">PSA stands for Pagamento por Serviços Ambientais, a payment scheme designed to incentivize local communities for their roles in environmental protection activities.&lt;SEP&gt;PSA is a payment program for environmental services aimed at financing ecological restoration and community involvement in conservation efforts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11946f35b487ac28aee0eba72daee33d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9f65c68d07780e52283e939e04463</data>
