<node id="Karaguá Vivo">
  <data key="d0">Karaguá Vivo</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Karaguá Vivo is a prominent local program associated with the Payment for Environmental Services (PSA) initiative, primarily focused on the conservation and restoration of mangrove ecosystems. This program emphasizes community involvement by providing financial incentives for local residents to participate in environmental activities, thus promoting sustainable management of natural resources.

As a pilot program, Karaguá Vivo serves as a foundational model for the PSA Manguezal program in Balneário Barra do Sul. It is implemented by Karaguá Ecotech, which strives to create a benchmark for Blue Carbon actions in the region of Santa Catarina. The central aim of Karaguá Vivo is to engage community members in the restoration of mangrove functions through several strategic approaches, including prioritized area selection, supervised planting, and continuous technical monitoring.

Karaguá Vivo is recognized for its role as the main program for monitoring and restoring mangrove ecosystems while actively involving community members who receive compensation for their participation. This multi-faceted approach ensures not only the ecological restoration of mangrove areas but also the economic benefit and engagement of local communities in environmental stewardship.&lt;SEP&gt;Karaguá Vivo is the main program of Karaguá, structured in two phases aimed at community training and active restoration of mangrove areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Karaguá Vivo is an organization involved in cultural and environmental initiatives related to the monitoring of carbon credits in the territory.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-11946f35b487ac28aee0eba72daee33d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f0cd8bd143fd3559ba56c62695e2b47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf31ac5454def849386bc7f894d8c2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9f65c68d07780e52283e939e04463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab5216ced144c274bc01b9f76450bfe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-644f99a306340252731a22af065c2b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daf3f3a511399d27baaafacc8a1db9af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10f1847a2487ac7c876527fa73acc8f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cf377716ee26ede13962ee6334fc04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57e814d734f12e6e0e03507f0db90b8b</data>
