  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SocialCarbon is an international carbon standard created in Brazil to facilitate the issuance of verifiable carbon credits while focusing on socio-environmental benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;SocialCarbon is an independent entity involved in the certification of carbon credits related to environmental projects.&lt;SEP&gt;SocialCarbon is a methodology referenced for its applicability in areas of ecological conservation and carbon capture.</data>
