<node id="Créditos de Carbono">
  <data key="d0">Créditos de Carbono</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Créditos de Carbono are tradable certificates issued for carbon dioxide equivalent emissions avoided or removed by the project initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Créditos de Carbono refers to carbon credits generated from the restoration projects, intended as a financial instrument to support environmental services and conservation.&lt;SEP&gt;Créditos de Carbono refers to carbon credits generated and sold by the project to support environmental sustainability initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Créditos de Carbono are tradable certificates representing the right to emit a certain amount of carbon dioxide, with increasing prices reflecting market demand.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f1b45c14b9998f471d578523b317bb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fd9f65c68d07780e52283e939e04463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9ac0e037b36bcaa7b84fc97e0480a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41caa912aa9f8b079fabe8c7285d8d78</data>
