<node id="ProManguezal">
  <data key="d0">ProManguezal</data>
  <data key="d1">legalregulation</data>
  <data key="d2">ProManguezal is a national program established in 2024 in Brazil aimed at the conservation, recovery, and sustainable use of mangrove territories.&lt;SEP&gt;ProManguezal is a national conservation program in Brazil aimed at sustainable use of mangrove ecosystems, established through a federal decree.&lt;SEP&gt;ProManguezal is a policy established by Decreto nº 12.045/2024 in Brazil that sets guidelines for the conservation and sustainable use of mangrove environments.&lt;SEP&gt;ProManguezal is a national program established to promote the conservation and sustainable use of Brazilian mangroves, formalized by Decreto nº 12.045/2024.&lt;SEP&gt;ProManguezal, established by Decree nº 12.045/2024, sets national guidelines for the conservation and sustainable use of mangroves.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab5216ced144c274bc01b9f76450bfe1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8391c4fcd2580effc0f006b72bb8036&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41caa912aa9f8b079fabe8c7285d8d78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-801a0e33323bfe79b6cbfaaca8800a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cf377716ee26ede13962ee6334fc04</data>
