<node id="Laboratório Karaguá Vivo">
  <data key="d0">Laboratório Karaguá Vivo</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Laboratório Karaguá Vivo is a cultural community laboratory project focusing on culture, technology, and the preservation of mangroves.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratório Karaguá Vivo is an initiative aimed at making technology accessible and empowering local residents through digital fabrication, while protecting the coastal ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratório Karaguá Vivo is a cultural project aimed at community education and production involving ecological technologies and methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratório Karaguá Vivo is a laboratory that offers six workshops as part of its educational program.&lt;SEP&gt;Laboratório Karaguá Vivo is a community cultural facility focusing on environmental preservation through digital modeling and 3D printing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56fa52e6f66e339f041d2b2bcfa35c9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de97259662535ffc45aa87131b91edcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-366c5f4f409b5d9134f24b7a85c0b74e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b1e215cb25487527b01e8441005cff0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4dc182d05fe8a824f6001879e64f17a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786227133</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tinkercad">
  <data key="d0">Tinkercad</data>
  <data key="d1">software</data>
  <data key="d2">Tinkercad is a free modeling software used in the workshops, accessible through a web browser.&lt;SEP&gt;Tinkercad is a web-based software used for 3D modeling, recommended for beginners participating in design workshops.&lt;SEP&gt;Tinkercad is the suggested free software for modeling workshops, which operates in a web browser without installation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56fa52e6f66e339f041d2b2bcfa35c9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed9bcf559b12248b1273da40f56068e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47f28922da8d397aaccd4d34f84e64f8</data>
