<node id="Ecobarreira">
  <data key="d0">Ecobarreira</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Ecobarreira refers to the ecological barrier prototypes developed in the laboratory, focusing on preservation and carbon credits.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecobarreira is a prototype developed during the workshops aimed at environmental preservation, incorporating the use of model-making techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;The ecobarreira is a proposed solution to manage waste in the Canal do Linguado, aimed at addressing waste accumulation in the mangrove area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56fa52e6f66e339f041d2b2bcfa35c9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4dc182d05fe8a824f6001879e64f17a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57e814d734f12e6e0e03507f0db90b8b</data>
