  <data key="d1">material</data>
  <data key="d2">PLA is a type of filament used in the 3D printing process, discussed in relation to its characteristics compared to PETG.&lt;SEP&gt;PLA is a biodegradable thermoplastic that is often used in 3D printing, discussed in the context of material testing for environmental use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47f28922da8d397aaccd4d34f84e64f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57e814d734f12e6e0e03507f0db90b8b</data>
